From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 23:37:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] Chapter selector: skipped waits stay passed; finer,
 whiter pointer trail; none on the preloader

- Going ahead with the selector marks the waits on the way as passed, so a skipped chapter cannot
  pull the page back to its fight or its letter (ACTION / PRESS D showed in chapter 3); prompts
  are cleared at the turn and again once the new chapter is on screen.
- The pointer's trail: 7 px cells, pure white for an exact negative, a little smaller and sparser.
- No trail on the preloader or the sound choice.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Yfam9H7FbQFsBx6yJZ8yW
